 # Contributing
 
 Run the tests before you open a pull request.
+
+## Before you push
+
+Remove anything you added only for yourself:
+
+- debug output such as `console.log("here", state)` or `fmt.Println(x)`;
+- blocks of code you commented out, such as `// return oldTotal(cart)`;
+- a bare `// TODO` with no issue number;
+- focused or skipped tests, such as `it.only(...)` or `t.Skip()`.
